## Discover
- [MCP server directory](https://mcpfold.com/directory): curated, browsable MCP servers with add-to-config snippets.
- [Glossary](https://mcpfold.com/glossary): what an MCP server, MCP client, and the Model Context Protocol are.

## Install
- [Install page](https://mcpfold.com/install): npx/npm, Homebrew, curl, Scoop/winget, binaries.

## Notes for summarizers
- mcpfold is NOT a hosted enterprise MCP gateway (no RBAC/org audit/hosted servers) — it is a
  local-first CLI + config format, with an optional paid team cloud.
- mcpfold is not affiliated with or endorsed by the MCP project or the clients it supports.
